WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:35.360
(Noodles)
The Super Chef Test has begun

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:36.440
where chefs across the country

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:37.420
are fighting for the highest honor
in the Chinese culinary world.

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.890
The Test ends the minute

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:41.250
five chefs get the passes.

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:44.000
Unexpectedly,

00:01:44.050 --> 00:01:45.110
there were four already.

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:46.830
Only one spot was left.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:48.080
No sweat, though.

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:50.010
My noodles were done

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:52.840
but Wang Hu raised his hand

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:55.290
right before I did.

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:57.980
That’s bad! If he gets the last pass,

00:01:58.090 --> 00:01:59.140
I’m doomed.

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:01.830
We've made our decision.

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:07.710
Final Battle The Legendary Cooking Arena

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:13.840
Wang Hu of Shaolin Restaurant...

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:14.880
Yes, sir!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.010
Failed!

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:36.830
What did you say?

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:39.050
He failed? Really?

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:39.670
What happened?

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:40.520
He failed!

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:41.270
No pass!

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.210
I failed?

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.180
Are you blind?

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.450
What’s wrong with my noodles? Say it!

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:51.490
Your noodles with Dongpo Pork are excellent.

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:52.840
So?

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:55.390
But your understanding of Su Dongpo

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.980
remains superficial.

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:58.220
What?

00:02:58.500 --> 00:02:59.280
Su Dongpo,

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:01.130
who had a dish after his name,

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:02.880
was a noble

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:04.110
and a great man.

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:06.910
He was never after fame or wealth,

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:09.550
but you buried his Dongpo Pork

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:11.480
with all sorts of delicacies

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:12.590
to make an extravagant presentation.

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:15.260
That’s simply too much.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:18.410
And it shows your lack of knowledge of him.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:20.080
Therefore,

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:21.570
your dish doesn’t deserve

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:23.370
to be called Unparalleled Scholar Noodles.

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:24.800
Please pack your staff and leave.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:27.370
What? No way!

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:28.750
I've spent the past four years

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:31.390
preparing for this very test!

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:32.080
My life

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:33.890
depends on it!

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:35.590
Who cares if it's Unparalleled Scholar Noodles

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.080
as long as it tastes good?

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:38.520
You hear me?

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:42.740
(Unparalleled Scholar)
Wait!

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:45.550
Please give me a second chance!

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:52.110
You’re next, right?

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:52.840
Yes, sir!

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:55.960
There are no toppings or any soup.

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:58.760
All I see is a bowl of plain noodles.

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.070
Liu Maoxing,

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:02.930
is that what you’re going to

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:04.260
serve the judges?

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.750
Yes, sir.

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:08.650
Just because Provincial Military Commander Li

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:09.980
and Master Lang Wen recommended you

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:11.740
doesn't mean you can get a safe pass.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:15.810
You can’t win with this kind of staple

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.700
in the real world!

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:55.860
What... what’s happening?

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:59.130
They... they bounced on my teeth!

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.520
Excuse me, sir?

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:04.380
Let’s take a bite.

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:14.780
The noodles are so elastic.

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.070
They bounce in my mouth

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:17.660
and knocked my teeth

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:18.590
with each bite!

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:20.500
I've never had

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:22.670
anything similar before.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:33.890
Liu Maoxing.

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:34.880
Yes, sir!

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:36.890
What makes your noodles

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:38.270
so special?

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:41.700
This is the key.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.460
I only added a few drops of this liquid

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:46.960
to the dough

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:49.390
instead of water.

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:51.240
That’s impossible!

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:52.410
Such elasticity

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:54.570
couldn’t be achieved

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:55.710
with the waterless dough.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:57.370
What exactly is this liquid?

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:58.460
Like some magic potion?

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:01.370
It’s lye water.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:02.310
Lye water!

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.540
The secret lye water!

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:06.540
Just as I thought.

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:09.190
Sir, what on earth is it?

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:10.870
It’s...

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.740
I’ll explain it to them.

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:14.640
Lanzhou City

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:16.070
in Gansu Province

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:18.500
has a secret liquid called lye water.

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:21.240
A few drops of it on the dough

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:22.410
will make

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:24.720
the noodles elastic.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:29.030
Lye water is a kind of solution

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:30.730
made of Lanzhou rocks and water.

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:31.900
Those rocks

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.490
are from the local sand desert

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:34.930
where farmers

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:35.980
burn tumbleweeds in holes into ashes.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.980
Once cooled and hardened,

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:38.920
they’ll turn into

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:41.070
man-made rocks.

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:42.900
This is it?

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:43.590
Correct.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:48.670
This is the first time I've seen the real thing.

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:50.370
Where did you get

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:52.340
such a rare item?

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:54.860
It belonged to my mother

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:56.560
when she cooked at Chrysanthemum Tower in Sichuan.

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:59.070
What? Chrysanthemum Tower in Sichuan?

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:00.390
Do you mean Chef Pai?

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:03.290
Yes. Whenever my mother made the dough,

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.730
she’d boil pieces of this rock

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:06.030
with water.

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:08.450
I made lye water the same way she did

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:10.660
to make my

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:12.270
Unparalleled Scholar Noodles.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:14.580
His noodles

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.270
have gone beyond elasticity.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:21.600
I agree. The fresh flour smells so nice.

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:25.210
Eggs in the dough instead of water

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:27.240
give those noodles a rich flavor.

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:28.840
I added spices

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.500
to the lard,

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.850
such as scallion, garlic, ginger

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:34.000
and chili

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:36.090
and cooked everything long enough.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.760
It was long! I ran out of patience

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:41.020
when waiting!

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:42.680
That explains it.

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:45.210
No wonder the lard

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:46.520
fully absorbed

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:47.890
the taste of those spices.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:49.710
You managed to bring out the flavor to the maximum

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:52.440
with a minimum number of ingredients.

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.000
That’s indeed outstanding!

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:55.960
So, Liu Maoxing,

00:07:56.640 --> 00:08:00.300
what makes your noodles unparalleled?

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.680
Sir, I believe

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:04.060
the taste matters the most

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:05.620
in cooking.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:08.330
Han Xin

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.140
wasn’t called a Unparalleled general

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:10.990
because of what he wore

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:11.890
or used to battle.

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:13.600
He earned the title by his own strength.

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:14.290
That’s why I believe

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:16.000
only if noodles taste the best

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:17.400
without toppings

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:19.310
and soup,

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:21.800
can they truly be called Unparalleled Scholar Noodles.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:27.080
Liu Maoxing of Yang Spring Restaurant has passed!

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:29.830
I did it!

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:31.040
Well done, Mao!

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:32.080
Congratulations!

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:34.860
From now on, I’m a Super Chef!

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.930
Mother, sister, I nailed it!

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:37.910
Guys...

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:41.660
Guys, you've got it wrong.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.040
This is only the beginning

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:46.570
of the Super Chef Test.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:48.420
Only the beginning?

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:50.130
What do you mean?

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:55.660
The preliminary round of the Super Chef Test

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:57.160
is now over.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.940
Your final test is about to begin.

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:01.130
Final test?

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:03.040
But what was that we just did?

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:04.540
That was to

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:05.770
weed out the weak.

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:07.490
The real battle starts now.

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:10.370
What?

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:12.840
All five of you

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:14.690
have interpreted

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:15.740
today’s theme perfectly.

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:18.800
Fighter Han of Dongjiang Restaurant

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:21.290
made full use of cattle, pig and chicken bones

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:23.560
and boiled them long enough

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.230
to produce a bowl of noodles

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:27.510
with overpowering soup,

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:28.540
hence the pass.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:31.860
Che Lin, known as Ryuuri Witch in Guangzhou,

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:34.210
made Wild Taste Noodles.

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:37.380
Only heroes of unparalleled scholar

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:38.780
can challenge themselves to that taste.

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:42.590
Eight-virtue Noodles made by Tang of Bancai Restaurant

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:44.500
were cooked to perfection

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:46.240
with impeccable knife skills and timing.

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:48.840
He’s more than qualified for the Test.

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:52.750
Genius Fei of Datong Restaurant

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:54.890
used the legendary hair-thin noodles

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:56.660
to represent an unparalleled scholar’s other half,

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:59.490
the fairest women gracefully.

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:01.060
And the youngest chef here,

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.340
Liu Maoxing of Young Spring Restaurant,

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:05.450
elevated plain noodles

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:06.990
to edible art

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:08.680
with the secret lye water

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:09.490
and passed the test.

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:11.600
The five of you

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:13.180
will be taking

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:14.680
the final test.

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:17.740
Meet me at the main gate!

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:53.980
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:29.590
Is this the real Cooking Arena?

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:31.770
The final test is getting started.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.480
Go to your positions!

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:33.850
An arena full of

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:35.660
the freshest

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:37.320
and top-quality ingredients!

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:38.880
What a huge pantry!

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:41.210
This legendary Cooking Arena

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:44.170
is specially designed and built

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:45.590
for the Super Chef Test.

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:48.330
Predecessors from Guangzhou

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:49.970
all fought tooth and nail

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:52.580
to win the biggest honor.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:56.480
I’ll be the winner this time.

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.150
Mao, let’s go!

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:04.370
Over there.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:08.390
This is it.

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:18.110
Look at those marks left by knives!

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:19.690
So many of them!

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:25.080
The floor even caved in!

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:26.500
It did.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.100
I thought this place was only used

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:29.320
every four years

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.840
for the Test.

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:33.670
Give it your all, Mao!

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:36.110
You must be a Super Chef!

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:39.990
I’ve been working so hard for this very day.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:40.810
It’ll pay off!

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:42.960
Yeah, right!

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:44.470
Don’t you get it?

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:46.370
This is no playground

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:47.900
for a kid like you.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:49.560
All those marks

00:13:49.650 --> 00:13:50.630
and dents

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:52.910
were left by countless chefs

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.830
who came here

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:55.540
to be Super Chefs.

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:57.430
You can’t imagine

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.380
how many talents

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:01.760
have taken up the challenge on this very spot.

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:05.900
Unfortunately,

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:06.950
few of them have succeeded.

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:08.060
While

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:11.310
hundreds and thousands of the others

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:13.190
have only ended up in tears.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.240
Those marks

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:18.340
are the witnesses

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:19.740
of everyone’s passion in this battle

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:21.160
whether he or she won or lost.

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:24.880
They’re still echoing within these walls.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.860
Over the past 4,000 years

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:28.280
of Chinese Cuisine,

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.050
our predecessors’ legacy

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.150
lives on

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:32.630
right here.

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:34.000
Chef Ruoh,

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:35.090
Chef Zhou Yu

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:36.290
and mother

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:37.770
all made a name for themselves here.

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:39.280
I cannot let them down!

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:42.200
You should be glad

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:43.910
that you’ve come this far.

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:45.350
However,

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:47.420
I, Tang, will be the ultimate winner!

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:48.990
Shorty,

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:51.310
leave a few marks

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:52.070
to prove that you’ve at least come,

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:54.360
then pack up and go home.

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:57.400
No, I won’t!

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:59.370
The winner will be me,

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:00.890
Liu Maoxing!

00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:23.320
Oh, my, the tension is way too strong!

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:24.490
I can’t help

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:25.360
feeling intermediated.

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:38.380
The Super Chef Final Test

00:15:38.760 --> 00:15:41.510
will now begin!

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:42.640
Isn’t that...?

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:44.200
Is she...?

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:49.070
Yes, I’m seeing it right.

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:51.610
The legendary female chef, Kaminaribana!

00:15:54.440 --> 00:15:56.200
She’s as famous

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:58.600
as Pai of Sichuan,

00:15:58.830 --> 00:15:59.970
known as Imperial Chef of Guangdong.

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:02.610
I know. Her talent is unparalleled.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:03.740
She’s so strict with herself

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:05.430
and the others

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:06.490
that she hasn’t had

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:08.070
a single apprentice to this day.

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:09.620
She’s a real legend!

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:13.130
I can’t believe she’s our judge.

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:16.320
It’s going to be

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:17.230
a tough battle.

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:19.170
She’s considered as

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:21.500
my mother’s rival.

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:26.410
Both Pai’s son Liu Maoxing

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:27.990
and Fei are here.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:31.670
This year’s test is going to be fun.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:35.070
Listen up! Your test is about to begin.

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:37.810
You're going to make...

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:42.870
(Noodles)

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:44.950
noodles again!

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:49.020
What? Again?

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:51.380
And the new theme is...

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:53.880
(Not)

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:55.590
(Noodles)

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:56.320
Not Noodles.

00:16:56.380 --> 00:17:01.390
(Noodles Not Noodles)

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:03.010
Not Noodles?

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:04.390
What does that mean?

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:07.600
So fake noodles then.

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:10.630
To make noodles but not noodles?

00:17:15.310 --> 00:17:17.040
Not Noodles...

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:20.480
You have until

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:21.910
the moon goes right above

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:23.700
that flag.

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:25.980
Begin!

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:38.310
Mao! Mao!

00:17:38.630 --> 00:17:39.210
What?

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:40.750
You tell me!

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:42.650
Others have all started.

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:44.430
Just hurry up!

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:45.980
You can’t fall behind!

00:17:46.030 --> 00:17:47.610
But I don’t get that theme.

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:56.190
What is he doing?

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:57.350
That’s impressive!

00:17:57.440 --> 00:17:59.500
Only one finger to support the whole body!

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:02.390
What’s he going to cook, though?

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:09.680
Fei is selecting ingredients already.

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:15.590
Potatoes...

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:32.080
Unbelievable!

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:33.760
He’s picking out the best ones

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:35.600
by throwing them up.

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:48.190
Is that magic or what?

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:50.190
Look, Mao!

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:50.710
What's up?

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:03.120
What dish

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:04.580
is she going to make?

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:35.810
That’s powerful enough.

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:38.950
The black powder is actually gunpowder.

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:40.090
What kind of dish

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:42.160
would need gunpowder?

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:43.800
Beats me.

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:45.500
Everyone is acting strange.

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:46.850
By the way,

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:48.230
what’s your plan, Mao?

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:50.070
What should I do?

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.040
What am I going to make?

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:54.350
(Not Noodles)

00:19:58.550 --> 00:19:59.900
Noodles that aren’t noodles...

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:02.240
Are there such things?

00:20:18.340 --> 00:20:20.050
He’s carrying the whole cattle!

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:35.670
It feels like an earthquake.

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:38.650
Yeah. Like a magnitude-6.

00:20:38.930 --> 00:20:39.440
Earthquake...

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:40.810
Wait a minute!

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:42.530
What’s wrong?

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:43.780
Are you alright, Mao?

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:45.750
The earthquake!

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:47.530
I got it!

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:48.590
What?

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:49.740
Yes!

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:51.180
Mao!

00:20:57.280 --> 00:20:58.030
There it is!

00:20:58.280 --> 00:20:59.800
What are you looking for?

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:08.840
Mao!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:13.390
Mao, are you alright?

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:20.320
What are you doing, Mao?

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:21.330
What is this?

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:37.170
Got it!

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:39.120
What’s that fish?

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:41.790
This is what I’m going to use

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:44.160
to make noodles that aren’t noodles.

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:45.890
Is that...

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:47.490
catfish?

00:23:14.850 --> 00:23:17.626
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.626 --> 00:23:19.100
Leave it to me, Meili.

00:23:19.100 --> 00:23:19.105
Leave it to me, Meili.
I'm sure my catfish noodles will do just fine.

00:23:19.105 --> 00:23:21.266
I'm sure my catfish noodles will do just fine.

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:23.200
Huh? Oh, I can't taste...

00:23:23.200 --> 00:23:25.236
I can't taste anything at all,

00:23:25.236 --> 00:23:27.196
something weird happened to my tongue.

00:23:27.364 --> 00:23:29.157
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.282 --> 00:23:32.186
A Fateful Rival Appears: Talented Young Chef Fei

00:23:32.186 --> 00:23:34.030
It will definitely be interesting!
